EOF
If your permissions refuse a heredoc, write the JSON to .trix-implementer.json with your file tool and run: trix wf submit implementer --file .trix-implementer.json (trix deletes the file; never commit it). If the command says the report is wrong, fix it and hand in again. A question only a person or the supervisor can answer: trix wf ask, with the question on stdin.

